OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 28 JUL
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1979FLondon Weekend Television is
OL,7,Fback on the air this morning at 8.45am
OL,8,Fwith Sesame Street, as planned.
OL,9,
OL,10,FLWT programmes were blacked out
OL,11,Fyesterday evening following a walkout
OL,12,Fby members of the Association of
OL,13,FCinematograph and Television
OL,14,FTechnicians (ACTT).
OL,15,
OL,16,FYesterday's action was part of an
OL,17,Fongoing national pay dispute between
OL,18,Ftechnicians and management. Unions
OL,19,Frejected an offer of a 9% pay rise and
OL,20,Fare asking instead for 25%.
OL,21,
